@startuml
' Diagrama PlantUML: ReasoningSystem vs “reentrenamiento” (RAG)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam maxMessageSize 220

title ReasoningSystem vs RAG (re-index) - relación e insumo/salida

actor Usuario as U

package "Flujo principal (runtime)" {
  [Streamlit\n(app.py)] as APP
  [Telegram\n(bot_telegram.py)] as TG
}

package "Razonamiento (reglas)" {
  [ReasoningSystem\n(reasoning_system.py)] as RS
  [User Profile\n(user_profile_manager.py)] as UPM
}

package "Motores de respuesta" {
  [LIVO SQL\n(livo_sql.py)] as LIVO
  [RAG Runtime\n(rag_system.py\n.buscar / buscar_con_analisis)] as RAGRUN
  [LLM Router\n(llm_providers.py)] as LLM
}

package "Re-index / 'Reentrenar' (offline o admin)" {
  [Inicializar RAG\n(inicializar_rag.py)] as RAGINIT
  [RAG Index Builder\n(rag_system.py\n.inicializar)] as RAGBUILD
  database "RAG Documents\n(RAG/...)" as RAGDOCS
  database "RAG Cache\n(rag_cache/vectorstore.pkl\n+ manifests)" as RAGCACHE
}

' --- Runtime flows ---
U --> APP : Pregunta
U --> TG : Pregunta

APP --> RS : analyze_and_respond(question, user_id, history)
TG --> RS : analyze_and_respond(question, user_id, history)

RS --> UPM : get/update profile (opcional)

RS --> APP : needs_clarification?\n+ clarification_response
RS --> TG : needs_clarification?\n+ clarification_response

APP --> LIVO : consultar(prompt)\n(si es datos)
APP --> RAGRUN : procesar_consulta_rag(prompt)\n(fallback o no-datos)
TG --> LIVO : consultar(prompt)
TG --> RAGRUN : buscar(prompt)

RAGRUN --> RAGCACHE : cargar índice/metadata

LIVO --> LLM : (cuando requiere generación/redacción)
RAGRUN --> LLM : (cuando requiere síntesis/respuesta)

APP --> U : Respuesta
TG --> U : Respuesta

note right of RS
ReasoningSystem:
- no entrena modelos
- gatekeeper: detecta faltantes
- produce contrapreguntas
end note

note right of RAGBUILD
"Reentrenar" aquí =
re-indexar documentos (FAISS)
no fine-tuning de LLM.
end note

' --- Re-index flows ---
RAGINIT --> RAGBUILD : inicializar(force_reload?)
RAGBUILD --> RAGDOCS : leer PDFs/DOCX/XLSX/CSV/PPTX
RAGBUILD --> RAGCACHE : guardar vectorstore.pkl\n+ manifest

APP ..> RAGBUILD : Botón "Recargar RAG"\n(inicializar(force_reload=True))

@enduml
